      "title": "MacH3 Metal",
      "properties": {},
      "widgets_values": [
        "## MacH3 Metal\nMiniMax H3 with sound, native on a Mac (h3.c Metal engine).\n\n**1.** On **Take**, pick a **Mode**: T2V, I2V, FL2V or R2V. That mode's group lights up; the others grey out and never load.\n\n**2.** Write the **prompt**, press **Run**. **Shot** plays it.\n\n**3.** To keep going: in **Settings** set **Continue** to *last take*, write what happens next, Run again. Shot adds it to the end.\n\n**Settings** (below): size, lane and continue. Amber = the dials that matter."
      ],
      "widgets_values_named": {
        "text": "## MacH3 Metal\nMiniMax H3 with sound, native on a Mac (h3.c Metal engine).\n\n**1.** On **Take**, pick a **Mode**: T2V, I2V, FL2V or R2V. That mode's group lights up; the others grey out and never load.\n\n**2.** Write the **prompt**, press **Run**. **Shot** plays it.\n\n**3.** To keep going: set **Continue** to *last take*, write what happens next, Run again. Shot adds it to the end.\n\n**Lane** (in Settings): *Quality* or *Speed (Turbo)*. Switching it sets the steps."
      },
      "color": "#432",
      "bgcolor": "#653"
    },
