      "title": "Settings: read me",
      "properties": {},
      "widgets_values": [
        "**Settings** sets every take's size, lane and continue.\n\n**Lane:** *Quality* = the released weights, 12 steps. *Speed (Turbo)* = the Turbo LoRA, 6 steps (its first take builds an 18 GB cache, once).\n\n**Continue:** *off* = a new shot. *last take* = carry on where the last take ended. *clip input* = continue the clip in the Continue group.\n\n**Engine** holds the rest: LoRA, sampler, speed preset, preview, reference size. The defaults are the measured ones."
      ],
      "color": "#432",
      "bgcolor": "#653"
    }
